# Packages that bypass MagicNet TUN and DNS capture when MAGICNET_APP_MODE=blacklist.
# One package name per line.
#
# Architecture note:
# - Domestic vs foreign traffic is decided mainly by geodata (geosite/geoip → cn-direct / proxy).
# - Do NOT try to list “all domestic apps” here; that does not scale and fights the rule-set model.
# - This file is only for explicit user opt-outs. It intentionally ships empty.
#
# MagicBox and WebUI discover installed Android VpnService implementations at runtime and can
# offer them as candidates. A recommendation must never silently become policy: only packages
# explicitly selected by the user are written here.
